title: vdiv.f32: (2^-125 - 2^-149) / 2 is flushed; x / -0 is -inf; denormal / denormal is 0 / 0 = default NaN
ref: A2.7 FPDiv(), FPRound(), FPUnpack(): with FPSCR = 0x03000000 on iOS (DN, FZ, round to nearest; ADR 0022) the exact quotient 2^-126 - 2^-150 (a tie that rounds to 2^-126) has exponent -127, so it is FPZero; flushed denormal operands make 0 / 0 an invalid operation

[code]
80ee201a    vdiv.f32 s2, s0, s1
c2ee201a    vdiv.f32 s3, s4, s1
c2ee032a    vdiv.f32 s5, s4, s6
c4ee043a    vdiv.f32 s7, s8, s8
7047        bx lr

[in]
s0 = 0x00FFFFFF     # 2^-125 - 2^-149
s1 = f32:2.0
s4 = 0x01000000     # 2^-125
s6 = 0x80000000
s8 = 0x00000005

[out]
s2 = 0
s3 = 0x00800000
s5 = 0xFF800000
s7 = 0x7FC00000
